# Columns (tab-separated): id, decision, pattern (POSIX ERE on the JSON-escaped command), description, check (a guard.sh check deciding when the pattern matches), review (the question a reviewer answers).
# Sources: packs/typescript/bun/rules/no-other-pm.yaml, packs/typescript/bun/rules/no-snapshot-update.yaml, packs/typescript/playwright/rules/no-snapshot-update.yaml, packs/typescript/prisma/rules/db-push.yaml, packs/typescript/prisma/rules/no-reset.yaml, packs/typescript/vitest/rules/no-pass-with-no-tests.yaml, packs/typescript/vitest/rules/no-snapshot-update.yaml
