typescript/bun/no-other-pm	ask	(^|[^A-Za-z0-9_-])(npm[[:space:]]+(install|i|ci|add)|pnpm|yarn)([[:space:];&|)]|$)	Dependencies are managed with bun, not npm, pnpm or yarn.
typescript/bun/no-snapshot-update	ask	(^|[^A-Za-z0-9_-])bun[[:space:]]+test[^|;&]*[[:space:]](-u|--update-snapshots)([[:space:]=;&|)]|$)	Updating bun test snapshots (-u, --update-snapshots) needs confirmation; the snapshots are part of the reviewed expectations.
